		(descr "Cable-tie slot, 2.0 x 4.5 mm unplated routed oval, long axis along the cable. Takes 2.5 mm and 3.6 mm nylon ties (about 1.0-1.3 mm thick) with JLCPCB's +/-0.2 mm NPTH tolerance. Used in pairs, one each side of a cat5 cable, so the tie clamps the cable jacket to the board behind the plug boot.")
